        "content": "KNOWLEDGE BASE INGESTION\n\nRUN THIS WORKFLOW:\n→ Once before activating the RAG chatbot\n→ Every time you update the store Google Doc\n\nWHAT IT DOES:\n1. Reads your Google Doc knowledge base\n2. Splits it into 500-token chunks (50 token overlap)\n3. Embeds each chunk using Gemini text-embedding-004\n4. Stores all chunks in Supabase documents table\n\nBEFORE RE-RUNNING (knowledge base update):\nRun this SQL in Supabase first to clear old chunks:\nDELETE FROM documents;\nThen run this workflow again.\n\nTO DO:\n→ Replace REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL_ID\n   in the Insert into Supabase node with your\n   actual Supabase credential ID from n8n.\n\nEXPECTED RESULT:\nSuccessful run = your Google Doc is now\nsearchable by the RAG chatbot via vector similarity.",
